# Thirteen months, and a year seven or eight behind the Gregorian one (§8.8).
# A date is a three-element ስብስብ, not a new value type, so indexing and ጻፍ
# already work on it.
#
# ከግሪጎሪ is what a checked snippet can use: fixed input, fixed output. ዛሬ
# cannot be, and correctly so — a page claiming today's date is wrong by
# tomorrow.
# expect: [2017፣ 1፣ 1]
# expect: [2016፣ 1፣ 1]
# expect: መስከረም ፩ ቀን ፳፻፲፯
# expect: ጳጉሜ
# expect: እውነት
# expect: 13

# Ethiopian New Year falls on 11 September — but on the 12th when the
# February that follows has 29 days.
ጻፍ(ከግሪጎሪ(2024፣ 9፣ 11))
ጻፍ(ከግሪጎሪ(2023፣ 9፣ 12))

አዲስዓመት = ከግሪጎሪ(2024፣ 9፣ 11)
ጻፍ(ወር_መጠሪያ(አዲስዓመት[1]) + " " + ወደ_ግዕዝ(አዲስዓመት[2]) + " ቀን " + ወደ_ግዕዝ(አዲስዓመት[0]))

# The thirteenth month is ጳጉሜ, of five days — six when ዓመት % 4 == 3.
ጻፍ(ወር_መጠሪያ(13))

# ዛሬ gives a date of three numbers, whatever instant the host supplied.
ቀኑ = ዛሬ()
ጻፍ(ርዝመት(ቀኑ) == 3 እና አይነት(ቀኑ[0]) == "ቁጥር")

ወሮች = []
ወር = 1
ወር <= 13 እስከሆነ ድረስ፦
    ጨምር(ወሮች፣ ወር_መጠሪያ(ወር))
    ወር = ወር + 1
ጻፍ(ርዝመት(ወሮች))
